<title>SPAIN: Spain's Telefonica 1996 income by division.</title>
<headline>Spain's Telefonica 1996 income by division.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Telefonica 1996 group income by business division (in billion of pesetas):</p>
<p> Basic telephony		     1,407.58   vs    1,213.01</p>
<p> International calls		   139.37   vs	145.75</p>
<p> Data transmission			44.93   vs	 40.91</p>
<p> Mobile telephony			259.99   vs	113.71</p>
<p> International business		353.77   vs	297.29</p>
<p> Advertising				35.04   vs	 29.65</p>
<p> Multimedia				  3.62   vs	  2.80</p>
<p> Others				   (281.78)  vs     (148.41)</p>
<p> TOTAL GROUP INCOME		  2,043.82   vs    1,773.96</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
